# The Recorder in the Biosystems Lab's basement: ObjType_Events $12,
# loc_DBF8 (ps2.asm:20156), an Obj_InvisibleBlock ($37) at B1 80,20.
# No d2 test: the first visit, with event_flags $12 ($C722) clear, is
# loc_E84A with ItemID_Recorder -- $1702 "... has found ..." then $1703
# "... has gotten hold of ..." -- and with party_member_join_next at 3 it
# goes to 4: the next knock at Rolf's door. The flag set, $1708 and the
# box closes. Before build 73 the port had no event $12: A gave $1708 and
# "level: event $12 is not ported" on stderr, and the story stopped here.
#
# The save is story_amy_grind moved to B1 79,20. The block's $2C is 9,
# loc_7278 row 9: 64 wide from x - 32, 64 high ending at y - 1. At
# x 1280, y 320 that is cells 78-81, rows 16-19 -- the machine on the
# map above the leader, not the cell its x,y names.

start slot 1 routes/saves/biolab_recorder.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $32 79 20
expect join-next 3
press up                     # blocked: turn to face the machine
wait idle
shot 01_facing_it
press a
wait idle
expect script $1702
shot 02_found
press c                      # $1703 runs on; the next button closes it
wait idle
expect script $1703
expect item Recorder
expect join-next 4
press a
wait idle
expect script $1708
press c
wait idle
expect join-next 4
shot 03_nothing_more
expect no-stderr not ported
